NOTE ON USE
-----------
The IEH-A is a RESEARCH instrument, not a clinical diagnostic tool. It is not
intended for individual clinical diagnosis or for any use that simulates a
health assessment. Research use with human participants requires the user's own
institutional/national ethics approval (see ETHICS.md). Attribution does not
imply endorsement by the authors, the IEH-A Consortium, or any institution.

